---
name: checkbox
type: registry:ui
title: Checkbox
description: A control that allows the user to toggle between checked and not checked.
dependencies:
  - bits-ui
  - '@lucide/svelte'
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/checkbox/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/checkbox/index.ts'
  - path: registry/items/components/checkbox/checkbox.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: '~/components/checkbox/checkbox.svelte'
---

Use checkbox for independent on/off choices. Bind `checked` or pass `indeterminate` for a partial state.
Pair with a label via matching `id` and `for` attributes.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
	import { Checkbox } from '~/components/checkbox';
</script>

<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
	<Checkbox id="terms" />
	<label for="terms">Accept terms and conditions</label>
</div>
```
